  "content": "\n\n<br>\n\n<center>\n\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/logo/logo.png\" width=\"100%\" alt=\"Friends&amp;Foes - 繁花哞花\" title=\"Friends&amp;Foes - 繁花哞花\">\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n<center>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/faboslav\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=請我喝杯咖啡&color=5b9c51&labelColor=5b9c51&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi\" alt=\"請我喝杯咖啡\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=成為贊助者&color=5b9c51&labelColor=5b9c51&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=patreon\" alt=\"Patreon\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/924964658169913404?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=ffffff&label=加入我們的 Discord&labelColor=5b9c51&color=5b9c51\" alt=\"加入我們的 Discord\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Moobloom\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=維基&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&labelColor=5b9c51&color=5b9c51\" alt=\"維基\">\n\t</a>\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n<p>\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Friends&Foes - 繁花哞花是 Friends&Foes 模組的一款小型擴充模組，為每種花朵新增對應的哞花變體。哞花可於草甸與繁花森林生態域中發現。您可前往 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Moobloom\">維基</a> 取得更多關於哞花的資訊。</span>\n</p>\n\t\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>🐮 哞花變體</h1>\n\n<table>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>血百合</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>天藍角罌粟</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_allium.png\" width=\"133\" alt=\"血百合哞花\" title=\"血百合哞花\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_azure_bluet.png\" width=\"146\" alt=\"天藍角罌粟哞花\" title=\"天藍角罌粟哞花\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>藍色蘭花</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>矢車菊</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_blue_orchid.png\" width=\"149\" alt=\"藍色蘭花哞花\" title=\"藍色蘭花哞花\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_cornflower.png\" width=\"139\" alt=\"矢車菊哞花\" title=\"矢車菊哞花\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>蒲公英</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>丁香</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_dandelion.png\" width=\"149\" alt=\"蒲公英哞花\" title=\"蒲公英哞花\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_lilac.png\" width=\"144\" alt=\"丁香哞花\" title=\"丁香哞花\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>山谷百合</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>橘色鬱金香</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_lily_of_the_valley.png\" width=\"140\" alt=\"山谷百合哞花\" title=\"山谷百合哞花\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_orange_tulip.png\" width=\"137\" alt=\"橘色鬱金香哞花\" title=\"橘色鬱金香哞花\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>雛菊</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>牡丹</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_oxeye_daisy.png\" width=\"134\" alt=\"雛菊哞花\" title=\"雛菊哞花\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_peony.png\" width=\"150\" alt=\"牡丹哞花\" title=\"牡丹哞花\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>粉色鬱金香</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>罌粟</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_pink_tulip.png\" width=\"137\" alt=\"粉色鬱金香哞花\" title=\"粉色鬱金香哞花\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_poppy.png\" width=\"142\" alt=\"罌粟哞花\" title=\"罌粟哞花\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>紅色鬱金香</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>玫瑰叢</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_red_tulip.png\" width=\"137\" alt=\"紅色鬱金香哞花\" title=\"紅色鬱金香哞花\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_rose_bush.png\" width=\"142\" alt=\"玫瑰叢哞花\" title=\"玫瑰叢哞花\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>向日葵</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>白色鬱金香</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_sunflower.png\" width=\"150\" alt=\"向日葵哞花\" title=\"向日葵哞花\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_white_tulip.png\" width=\"137\" alt=\"白色鬱金香哞花\" title=\"白色鬱金香哞花\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n\n<h1>⚙️ 其他擴充模組／相容資料包</h1>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><a style=\"font-size: 18px;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut-fabric\">Friends&Foes - 養蜂人小屋</a></li>\t\n\t<li><a style=\"font-size: 18px;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/repurposed-structures-friends-and-foes-datapack\">結構再利用 - Friends and Foes 相容資料包</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n\n<h1>💬 社群</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t歡迎 <a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\">加入我們的 Discord 伺服器社群</a> 進行聊天、分享您的創作、提出任何問題，或單純獲取模組的最新開發動態，並在有新版本釋出時收到通知。此外，若發現任何崩潰或錯誤，也請不吝透過 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/issues\">GitHub Issues 回報</a>。\n</p>\n\n<br>\n\n<h2>👋 支援</h2>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">開發此模組是我的興趣所在，因此無論是否有獲得支援，我都會持續更新。雖然我大多数的空閒時間都花在模組開發上，但如果您仍想支持我，可以透過 <a style=\"font-size: 18px;\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\">Patreon</a> 或 <a style=\"font-size: 18px;\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/faboslav\">Ko-fi</a> 進行贊助。在此衷心感謝各位的支持。</span></p>\n\n<br>\n\n<h1>📜 授權條款</h1>\n\n<p>\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">本模組採用 <a style=\"font-size: 18px;\" href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/LICENSE.txt\">CC BY-NC-ND 4.0</a> 授權條款。</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">歡迎參考我的原始碼，了解我在撰寫此模組時如何實作與解決各項問題，並可自由將相關程式碼片段融入您自己的程式碼中。此外，也歡迎在任意整合包中使用本模組（若能附上來源或連結回此頁面，我們將深表感謝）。</span>\n</p>",
